        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"36b9aad1-03cf-4323-bbd0-8c9b45617536\",\"review_text\":\"Very good to listening music 🎶\"},{\"review_id\":\"38723aa3-210d-42b9-9115-e8659f51fbc6\",\"review_text\":\"I love how intuitive Spotify is, and it's definitely worth upgrading to skip the ads! As of the latest update, 12/2022, Spotify is straight up buggy. I don't know what the developers did, but they need to fix it. Huge playback issues. It randomly jumps from my playlist to all of a sudden playlist radio, when I didn't ask it to do that. If I pause it and then come back, it errors out and won't continue playing. Why am I paying for premium? Fix this, please. Sick of having constant errors.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae241bfe-f25a-4398-a4c3-545b2b13d2be\",\"review_text\":\"❤️❤️❤️❤️💪🏽\"},{\"review_id\":\"d4d66ba8-d19f-477c-8da8-12602c776b40\",\"review_text\":\"Just wow that\"},{\"review_id\":\"4883ce04-2099-4409-a68e-0f78c5b33d92\",\"review_text\":\"One of the best music apps out there\"},{\"review_id\":\"79e45816-5f50-461a-8af5-35e07166c5f8\",\"review_text\":\"It's a nice app to play songs... But since I open this app everything is wrong and when I restart it...it's just the same thing so pls fixe this app just 🙏🙏🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"96ff70cc-4cc4-4f1b-9b33-cd0e99d86fe9\",\"review_text\":\"Useless app I have ever seen\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa67d477-680b-4301-b54c-842acb1120a0\",\"review_text\":\"😘\"},{\"review_id\":\"eb5dbb5b-5071-4e63-a419-c0e950e000d8\",\"review_text\":\"This app sucks\"},{\"review_id\":\"396f5604-e160-4b8e-b5b3-23dda86d3fb6\",\"review_text\":\"ছোপ ছোপোল\"}]}"
